  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Casting class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you trigger a wild magic event (but not a major event), you may choose to negate the event by taking 2 points of Constitution burn. This decision must be made before the roll is made on the wild magic table. If you possess at least 4 wild magic feats, you may use this ability on a major event (see Variant Rules) by accepting 4 points of Constitution burn. If you have at least 6 wild magic feats, the burn cost is reduced by 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Ability Burn</strong></p>\n<p>Ability burn functions as ability score damage, but may not be removed by any means other than 8 hours of resting, which removes all burn.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/wild-magic-feats#toc0\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
